{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Waldhüter Arvid (Start)\n\n> „Ach du Scheiße, was willst du denn hier?“\n\n*Hüter der Schutzhütte*","x":220,"y":0,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"arvid_zinsbachtal","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Waldhüter Arvid\n\n> „Zinsbachtal, Ja, ich erinnere mich. Da war es schön. Damals.“","x":-200,"y":280,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_bier","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Waldhüter Arvid\n\n> „Macht ein Euro!“","x":240,"y":280,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"6ddf53f938027555","type":"text","text":"Wie, damals? Nach meiner Karte ist es nur noch ein Katzensprung.","x":-380,"y":480,"width":240,"height":94,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fbde544d83d5985a","type":"text","text":"Ja ja, früher war alles besser. Ich weiß.","x":-100,"y":484,"width":250,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"30be59c1316ff318","type":"text","text":"Ein Schnäppchen, her damit!","x":180,"y":484,"width":250,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bf8c284075e01e32","type":"text","text":"Was gibts denn für ne Sorte?","x":440,"y":484,"width":210,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"dc86ada276dc07bb","type":"text","text":"War nicht so gemeint. Hast du ein Bier über?","x":670,"y":484,"width":250,"height":90,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"66c32247c37edb3d","type":"text","text":"Große Worte für ein Stück Gammelfleisch.","x":940,"y":480,"width":250,"height":94,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"48807567a46ef905","type":"text","text":"Katzensprung? Na das muss ja ne tolle Katze sein.","x":-380,"y":627,"width":250,"height":87,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"87db4b492c156d3b","type":"text","text":"Das weißt du also? Mal sehen was du noch so weißt.","x":-99,"y":629,"width":250,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_penner","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Waldhüter Arvid\n\n> „Ein Satz heiße Ohren gefällig?“","x":760,"y":280,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"01ad16df7fac9851","type":"text","text":"Ich habe noch zwei Flaschen im Rucksack. Ich gebe eine aus. ","x":387,"y":781,"width":317,"height":66,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"26e0127349dbad1d","type":"text","text":"Sorry ist keins mehr da. Hab gerade das letzte leer gemacht.","x":387,"y":671,"width":317,"height":87,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b286cc1e4bccbdda","type":"text","text":"Tja so wird das hier nichts. Du reitest dich gerade tief in die Scheiße Kleiner. ","x":862,"y":671,"width":328,"height":85,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fe3aa28da4e1b3c2","type":"text","text":"Wäre nicht das erste mal.","x":901,"y":784,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"5817a4cdfaa5b3cd","type":"text","text":"Danke, sehr nett. Aber nein. Behalte sie lieber, du wirst sie brauchen. Glaubs mir.","x":387,"y":883,"width":317,"height":77,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2fc7c12a7c669246","type":"text","text":"Wenn du glaubst, dass dich das weiterbringt. Dann nur zu.","x":901,"y":889,"width":259,"height":71,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f84bca563c7eaeeb","type":"text","text":"OK, ich geh dann mal lieber weiter. Schönen Tag noch.","x":262,"y":1020,"width":250,"height":79,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c9b4364dfe29982f","type":"text","text":"Wie du meinst. Viel Glück.","x":262,"y":1140,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_after_chest","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Waldhüter Arvid (Event: Truhe)\n\n> „Sieh an, du hast die alte Truhe aufbekommen. Dann hast du jetzt das Licht.“\n\n*(Trigger: Nach Öffnen der Truhe)*","x":1400,"y":0,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"arvid_opt_chest_1","type":"text","text":"Was fange ich mit dem Licht an?","x":1300,"y":200,"width":250,"height":75,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arvid_opt_chest_2","type":"text","text":"Gehörte der Kristall dir?","x":1600,"y":200,"width":250,"height":75,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arvid_chest_usage","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Arvid\n\n> „Es leuchtet dir den Weg durch den tiefen Silberstollen im Norden. Aber pass auf das Graumännchen auf.“","x":1300,"y":330,"width":260,"height":105,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_chest_mine","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Arvid\n\n> „Nein, das hat der alte Hüter vor mir dagelassen. Nimm es mit – auf den finsteren Pfaden wirst du es brauchen.“","x":1600,"y":330,"width":260,"height":105,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_idle","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Waldhüter Arvid (Standard / Idle)\n\n> „Was lungerst du hier noch rum? Geh die Pfade erkunden!“\n\n*(Trigger: Kein neues Event)*","x":1950,"y":0,"width":350,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"arvid_opt_idle_1","type":"text","text":"Welchen Weg empfiehlst du mir?","x":1880,"y":200,"width":240,"height":75,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arvid_opt_idle_2","type":"text","text":"Ich gehe ja schon.","x":2160,"y":200,"width":220,"height":75,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arvid_idle_bye","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Arvid\n\n> „Na also. Bewegung schadet dir nicht.“\n\n*(schließt)*","x":2160,"y":330,"width":220,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_after_giant","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Waldhüter Arvid (Event: Riese)\n\n> „Du warst drüben am Wehr, stimmt's? Der alte Dickschädel hockt immer noch da.“\n\n*(Trigger: Nach Besuch von Weg 3)*","x":1400,"y":520,"width":360,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"arvid_opt_giant_1","type":"text","text":"Er will das Wehr nicht öffnen.","x":1300,"y":720,"width":250,"height":75,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arvid_opt_giant_2","type":"text","text":"Ein imposanter Kerl.","x":1600,"y":720,"width":250,"height":75,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"arvid_giant_wehr","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Arvid\n\n> „Verständlich. Wenn er die Schleusen öffnet, wird seine Quelle fortgespült. Keine leichte Wahl.“","x":1300,"y":850,"width":260,"height":105,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_giant_imposant","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Arvid\n\n> „Und stur wie die Felsen des Schwarzwaldes. Lass dich von ihm nicht einschüchtern.“","x":1600,"y":850,"width":260,"height":105,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"arvid_idle_tipp","type":"text","text":"### 🌲 Arvid\n\n> „Schau in dein Tagebuch. Ich bin nicht deine Sekerärin.“","x":1880,"y":330,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"5"}
	],
	"edges":[
